Lemma vm_only_fixed_done : vm_only mo (with_mmap_replacement (Z_to_bv 64 MAPFX) aw nw (with_vmmaps fixed_done_h mo)).
Proof.
ltac2:(KReplay.run1 (kr_t_EKPlace ()) ["Fixed"] "p;2p;1p;4p;3p;5g048@j2;Tg003ij10Tg0064j13Tg02?1j22Tg04U8j4:Tg00MWj19Tg02]Jj15Tg02^Aj14Tg009Ij21Tg04c]j36Tg04d_j57Tg04eej58Tp,2moR0g04]DR1/;0R2g00@9#0#0#0#0#0#0#3R3g04\P'2R4p,2awR5p,2nwR6P2C:%93%50#4'19610P4P5P6P2g00Aeg01cl'1D7D8o"). Qed.
